=2 Walkthrough
* Enter {z:Monastic Cavern} through the (G-7) entrance in {z:Davoi} for a cutscene that starts this quest.
** If you choose not to accept this quest, you will not be given the chance to start it again until the next Conquest Tally.
* Speak to {n:Faulpie}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (E-8) for a cutscene.
* Trade {n:Faulpie} a {i:Buffalo Hide|Buffalo Hide|1628}, {i:Ram Leather|Ram Leather|851}, and 10,000 gil.
* Wait until the next game day to talk to {n:Faulpie} again who will give you an {i:Orc Cutting|Orc Cutting|1865} and instructions on how to craft it into an {i:Orc Helm|Orc Helm|15200}.
** Zoning is no longer required.
* Synthesize an {i:Orc Helm|Orc Helm|15200} using the following recipe:

