{@g:Earth Crystal}
\**Main Craft:** {p:Leathercraft} - (74) {br}**Sub Craft(s):** {p:Smithing} - (31), {p:Clothcraft} - (22)
>Ingredients
* {i:Earth Crystal|Earth Crystal|4099}
* {i:Orc Cutting|Orc Cutting|1865}
* {i:Iron Sheet|Iron Sheet|662}
* {i:Linen Thread|Linen Thread|819}
* {i:Wool Thread|Wool Thread|820}
* {i:Manticore Hair|Manticore Hair|1163} x2
